sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Quan tri vien
    participant FE_Admin as Admin Console
    participant ContentSvc as Content Service
    participant RabbitMQ as RabbitMQ Broker (saigonvoice.topic)
    participant TransSvc as Translation/TTS Service
    participant ExtTranslator as MyMemory API / Seed Dict
    participant EdgeTTS as Edge-TTS Runner
    participant Disk as Local Storage (/app/storage/audio)

    Admin->>FE_Admin: Tao hoac cap nhat POI
    FE_Admin->>ContentSvc: POST / PUT /api/content/admin/pois
    ContentSvc->>ContentSvc: Luu POI, tao poi_publish_event (PENDING)
    ContentSvc->>RabbitMQ: Publish PoiEventPayload (routingKey: poi.created / poi.updated)
    RabbitMQ->>TransSvc: Giao thong diep cho PoiEventListener
    loop Xu ly doc lap 4 ngon ngu (vi, en, ja, ko)
        alt Tieng Viet (vi) hoac co van ban thu cong (MANUAL)
            TransSvc->>TransSvc: Dung nguyen van ban goc, bo qua buoc dich
        else Ngoai ngu (en, ja, ko)
            TransSvc->>ExtTranslator: Goi dich (MyMemory chunk <= 450 bytes)
            ExtTranslator-->>TransSvc: Tra ve tieu de, tom tat da dich
        end
        TransSvc->>EdgeTTS: edge-tts --voice <voice> --text <text> --write-media <path>
        EdgeTTS->>Disk: Ghi file am thanh poi_{id}_{lang}_{hash}.mp3
        EdgeTTS-->>TransSvc: Tra ve exitCode=0 va thoi luong
        TransSvc->>TransSvc: Luu ban ghi vao tts_audio_cache
        TransSvc->>RabbitMQ: Publish PoiAudioReadyEvent (routingKey: poi.audio.ready)
    end
    RabbitMQ->>ContentSvc: PoiAudioUpdateService tieu thu poi.audio.ready
    ContentSvc->>ContentSvc: Cap nhat poi_translation: audio_status=READY, audio_url
    ContentSvc-->>FE_Admin: Trạng thai POI chuyen sang READY tren CMS
